---
// Series Intro — short description of the series concept
---

<section id="series" class="series-intro">
  <div class="container si-inner">
    <div class="si-text">
      <p class="section-label">About the Series</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">What is Show Papi?</h2>
      <p class="section-body">
        <strong>Show Papi</strong> is a children's book series that celebrates the
        joyful bond between a child and their father — and the pride that comes
        from learning something new.
      </p>
      <p class="section-body">
        In each book, a young child earns the chance to say <em>"I'll Show Papi!"</em>
        — sharing a new skill with the most important person in their world. From
        ABCs to 123s and beyond, every title builds early literacy and numeracy
        while wrapping kids in warmth, encouragement, and family love.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="si-cards">
      <div class="si-card">
        <span class="card-icon">🎓</span>
        <h3>Early Learning</h3>
        <p>Each book targets a core developmental milestone — letters, numbers, shapes, and more.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="si-card">
        <span class="card-icon">❤️</span>
        <h3>Family First</h3>
        <p>Stories rooted in the father-child relationship, celebrating everyday pride and connection.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="si-card">
        <span class="card-icon">📖</span>
        <h3>Growing Series</h3>
        <p>New titles are always on the way — each one a new milestone, a new adventure.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .series-intro {
    background: #fff;
  }

  .si-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .si-text .section-body {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .si-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .si-card {
    background: var(--color-cream);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .si-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .si-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .si-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
